The '''Processional Way''' was a large boulevard leading to the [[Imperial Palace|Jedi Temple]] on [[Coruscant]].

==Description==
[[File:Processional Way.png|thumb|The Processional Way as seen from the Temple entrance.]]
The Processional Way was a wide surface-level avenue that led to the [[Imperial Palace|Jedi Temple]] on [[Coruscant]]. The way terminated in a ceremonial staircase crowned with the statues of two [[Jedi]] [[Jedi Guardian|Warrior Masters]] and two [[Sage Master]]s as well as four pylons with reliefs of the [[Four Masters]], before it led into the [[Great Hall (Jedi Temple)|Great Hall]].<ref name="CL" /> 

It was situated within the [[Jedi Order]]'s [[Palace Court|Temple Precinct]] area of the [[Imperial City|Galactic City's]] [[Federal District]], the [[capital]] of the [[Galactic Republic]] and later the [[Galactic Empire]].<ref name="CL" /> Succeeding the [[Politics|Republic]], the Empire's head of state, [[Galactic Emperor|Emperor]] [[Darth Sidious|Palpatine]], laid claim to the Temple Precinct and its central [[Jedi temple]], with the locations renamed "Palace Precinct" and "Imperial Palace" respectively.<ref name="Tarkin">[[Tarkin (novel)|''Tarkin'']]</ref>

==History==
[[File:SidiousVaderCelebrationRally-2017DarthVader1.png|thumb|left|224px|Citizens celebrate the fall of the Jedi on the Processional Way]]
In [[19 BBY]],<ref name="GA">''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]''</ref> [[Anakin Skywalker|Darth Vader]] [[Operation: Knightfall|led]] the [[501st Legion]] of [[clone trooper]]s down the Processional Way to storm the Temple and [[Great Jedi Purge|massacre]] the [[Jedi]],<ref name="ROTS">{{Film|III}}</ref> after which the Temple was soon claimed by the newly-[[Proclamation of the New Order|formed]] [[The galaxy|Galactic]] Empire as its Emperor's palace.<ref name="CL" />

At the [[celebration marking the eradication of the Jedi Order]] hosted by [[Grand Vizier]] [[Mas Amedda]] shortly after the proclamation of the [[New Order]], the boulevard was densely populated by individuals attending the event, and upon the Way's steps was installed an [[Lightsaber incinerator|incinerator]] for Jedi [[lightsaber]]s.<ref name="DLOTS 1" />

